<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="List medical equipment for donation or request equipment as a verified NGO.">
  <title>CareCycle | Medical equipment donations</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/home.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/app.css">
  <script src="/app-nav.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/app-nav', { activePage: 'home' }) %>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <span class="hero-kicker">Donors and verified NGOs</span>
        <h1>Donate medical equipment.</h1>
        <p>List equipment you want to give, review requests from verified NGOs, and exchange contact details after accepting a request.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <% if (currentUser.role === 'donor') { %>
            <a class="button-primary" href="/donate">List equipment</a>
            <a class="button-secondary" href="/donor/dashboard">View my donations</a>
          <% } else if (currentUser.role === 'ngo') { %>
            <a class="button-primary" href="/ngo/dashboard">Open NGO dashboard</a>
          <% } else { %>
            <a class="button-primary" href="/admin/dashboard">Open admin dashboard</a>
          <% } %>
        </div>
        <p class="process-note">Organization verification reviews NGO evidence. It does not certify equipment condition or medical fitness.</p>
      </div>

      <aside class="listing-guide" aria-labelledby="listing-guide-title">
        <span class="page-eyebrow">Listing information</span>
        <h2 id="listing-guide-title">Describe equipment before arranging a transfer.</h2>
        <dl>
          <div><dt>Equipment and condition</dt><dd>Select a category and describe wear, defects, or missing parts.</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Quantity and location</dt><dd>State how many units you offer and the collection area.</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Your photos</dt><dd>Add up to three equipment images to help NGOs review your listing.</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <p>This is guidance, not an available equipment listing.</p>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="process-section" aria-labelledby="process-title">
      <div class="section-heading"><span>How CareCycle works</span><h2 id="process-title">List, request, and review.</h2><p>Pickup scheduling and receipt acknowledgement are planned features.</p></div>
      <div class="process-grid">
        <article><span class="step-number">01</span><h3>List your equipment</h3><p>Add the condition, quantity, location, and helpful photos.</p></article>
        <article><span class="step-number">02</span><h3>NGOs request equipment</h3><p>Verified NGOs browse listings and explain the quantity they need.</p></article>
        <article><span class="step-number">03</span><h3>Review the request</h3><p>The donor accepts or rejects. Accepted requests show each party's contact details in their request pages.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="equipment-strip">
      <div><span class="strip-label">Supported categories</span><h2>Equipment you can list.</h2></div>
      <div class="equipment-labels"><span>Wheelchairs</span><span>Walkers</span><span>Canes</span><span>Stethoscopes</span></div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer><a class="home-brand footer-brand" href="/home"><span class="home-brand-mark">C</span><span>CareCycle</span></a><p>Medical equipment donation for donors and NGOs.</p></footer>
</body>
</html>
